if?t=1674106908\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284480/extras/2bd08c68fbc84e28b5275da6808b060c.webm?t=1674106908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2284480/extras/2bd08c68fbc84e28b5275da6808b060c.mp4?t=1674106908\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Soar it's still early in development, so expect full list of game modes at later date. Meanwhile, feel free to wishlist and connect with us!</strong>",
